{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": "039A",
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER039A.YBC",
      "sha256": "efcb45206208a9c08a1aa0a622b361b988045a38502f4077bd27688adc01c18e",
      "text_count": 87,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 114,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "呼～～～！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 136,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "我啊，說不定不能通過測驗呢～～！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 186,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "我也是啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 212,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 238,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 272,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "如果……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 306,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "如果……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 340,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "如果沒辦法通過測驗的話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 362,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "要不要兩個人一起努力？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 396,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "一起？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 436,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11
          ],
          "text": "在能夠有自信通過測驗之前，\n一起修行怎麼樣？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 470,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "在這裡……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 504,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "沒錯！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 532,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "在這個世界裡呀，\n可是有四個賢者學舍唷。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 566,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 606,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "雖然如此，我們要留在這裡，\n並不是因為誰幫我們做了決定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 628,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "而是因為我們兩個是在這裡認識的嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 662,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "凱洛……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 702,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "雖然我不是很清楚，不過，\n這裡好像發生了什麼很嚴重的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 730,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "不但中央校舍被摧毀了，\n還有好多怪物來襲擊我們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 764,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 798,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "雖然如此，我們還是在這裡變成了朋友。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 820,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "所以呢，欸嘿嘿。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 842,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "雖然我不是很明白這背後的因緣啦……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 864,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "不過，我還是想好好加油！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 890,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 916,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 956,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "我也是，如果可以的話，\n我也想跟妳一起在這裡求學。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 984,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "關於愛爾梅納斯、關於賢者、\n還有關於這裡的大家……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1006,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "我想瞭解的事情，有好多好多。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1040,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "嗯！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1062,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "而且呢，大家也都想多瞭解我們一點呢！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1096,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "……嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1122,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1148,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1210,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "妳們兩個的心情我能夠瞭解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1264,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "妳是……艾爾雪學姊……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1326,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "就和我跟艾爾雪的心情是一樣的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1352,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1398,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "法娜學姊……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1432,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "那麼，難道……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1458,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1504,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "在那月光下，霧氣瀰漫的靜寂中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1566,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "在那無聲地搖曳的真實之畔。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1628,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "讓我們牽起對方的手。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1696,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "為了從今以後互相扶持，結起彼此間的羈絆，\n在此宣誓。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1718,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1764,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            55,
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "歡迎兩位來到這世界邊緣的學舍。\n從今天開始，\n伊諾森提雅就是各位的第二個故鄉了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1786,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1844,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "老師……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1866,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1924,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "好耶！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1946,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "Ｙｅｓ！　Ｙｅｓ！　Ｙｅｓ！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1968,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 1990,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2052,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "感謝那高貴的虛空之翼。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2074,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "造訪這世界邊緣的孩子們呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2096,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "有著澄澈眼神的精靈們呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2122,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            68
          ],
          "text": "請讓我們聽聽你們追求的誓願。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2144,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            69
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2174,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            70
          ],
          "text": "就算將來的路途嚴苛……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2196,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            71
          ],
          "text": "沒有盡頭。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2218,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            72
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2276,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "也要順著自己率直的心意去走。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2298,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2320,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2354,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "要完成成為賢者的心願。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2388,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "要貫徹自己追求的目標。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2410,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            78
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2432,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            79
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2458,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            80
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2484,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2522,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            82,
            83,
            84
          ],
          "text": "我相信你們。\n在這處於世界邊緣的學舍裡，以你們的真心，\n讓這誓言持續，直到永遠……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2556,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "是！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "039A",
          "source_offset": 2590,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "是！！"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 2622,
          "opcode": 15,
          "string_index": 0,
          "target": "data/adv/dat/Chapter040.ybc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 40,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER040.YBC",
      "sha256": "bc5161add604ec20867ce183a1fb8dda94851b62507f448b3275a6401b00451b",
      "text_count": 103,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 112,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1,
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "《不過這樣真的好嗎？\n　在愛爾梅納斯的邂逅，不會是單純的偶然。\n　而且，不論是她們的背景、本性，\n　或是她們所追求的事物，我們都不清楚。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 142,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "《只是單純地收容她們，\n　不對她們有任何疑問，就這樣地包容她們，\n　然後視如己出地照顧她們。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 184,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8,
            9,
            10,
            11
          ],
          "text": "現在回想起來……當初，老師是多麼地辛苦。\n而當我受他照顧的那個時候，\n卻完全都沒有注意到。\n現在，我對他們所必須付出的包容，\n應該可以當作是我對老師的報答吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "……老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 298,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "凱洛特……\n我可以問妳一件事情嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 332,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "嗯啊？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 370,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "妳……\n妳第一次見到我的時候，\n為什麼知道我是這裡的老師呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 404,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "嗯～～啊，因為我看了你的日記……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 426,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "「會好好寫日記的人，不會是壞人。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 448,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "這是我爺爺說的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 474,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 506,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "要好好寫日記的話，\n就得仔細地回想每一天的種種……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "不論是好事或是壞事，\n如果不能在心中一一地面對，\n就沒辦法寫下去了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 572,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "所謂的壞人呀，\n不就是沒辦法好好反省自己的人嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 598,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 632,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "欸嘿嘿，既然我自己也是這樣想的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 654,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "那就抱歉啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 676,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "我不應該偷看你的日記的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 698,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "我會好好反省的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 736,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "…………\n嗯嗯，嗯～的確。\n不過既然看都已經看了，也沒辦法追究了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 762,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 792,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "而且，如果只是因為看了這本日記，\n就讓妳對伊諾森提雅這麼地有信心的話。\n那就沒有什麼比這更令人開心的了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 826,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "欸嘿嘿……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 858,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            43,
            44
          ],
          "text": "這麼說……\n妳是為了什麼會來到這裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 892,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "因為中央校舍已經整個都亂七八糟了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 914,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "所以我就朝著森林裡的城堡走過來了！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 940,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "就妳一個人？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 974,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "嗯！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1000,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1026,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1062,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            51,
            52,
            53,
            54
          ],
          "text": "《羅亞爾‧聖提已經墮入了混沌之中……\n　她真的是從那裡過來的嗎？\n　在純潔之盾連安蒂米昂都無法收復的時候？\n　就算是如此，還是來了這裡？》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1080,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "真是多虧妳能走到這裡了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1114,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "嗯～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1136,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "因為有人教我怎麼走過來嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1162,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "……誰？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1196,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "一個鬍渣很多的大叔。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1222,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1256,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "他看起來是個很快樂的人呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1282,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "……在哪裡碰到的？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1316,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "在森林裡面的城堡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1342,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "……他說他叫什麼名字？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1376,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1402,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "……這傢伙。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1436,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "你認識他？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1464,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "他啊，\n待在一個有好～粗的鎖鏈鎖起來的房間裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1492,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            70,
            71
          ],
          "text": "他說因為在那裡很安全，\n所以要在那邊休息一下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1530,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            72,
            73,
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………\n謝謝妳，凱洛特。\n這真的是很重要的消息。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1564,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "嗯！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1586,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "那，老師晚安！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1612,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，晚安。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1700,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            78,
            79
          ],
          "text": "就算不特地去回想，\n老朋友的臉龐也會自然地浮現在腦海中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1726,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            80
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1760,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "真是個好孩子。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1792,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            82,
            83
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯……\n而且，看來凱洛特真的是老爺子的孫女呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1826,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "那就非得好好照顧她不可了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1854,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            85,
            86
          ],
          "text": "那孩子的祖父是我的同學呀，\n答哈忒瑪的貝爾納雷信。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1876,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "他是被人歌頌為「弓神」的森林賢者呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1902,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "那麼，那孩子會來到安蒂米昂的原因是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1942,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            89,
            90
          ],
          "text": "也許是對貝爾納雷信的思念，\n把她引導到這裡來的吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 1980,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            91,
            92,
            93
          ],
          "text": "……現在這種情況下，\n正好也需要多一個目光銳利的孩子呢，\n她來了，真的是一大助力呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 2020,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            94,
            95
          ],
          "text": "既然你也這麼想的話，\n那我當然也只有為老朋友感到高興了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 2042,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            96
          ],
          "text": "而且也可以跟她多聊聊旅途上的見聞了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 2080,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            97,
            98,
            99
          ],
          "text": "……老師。\n請不要老是說這種喪氣話呀。\n純潔之盾的未來，不是才正要開始嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 2114,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "……什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 40,
          "source_offset": 2142,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            101,
            102
          ],
          "text": "等你跟羅弗利見過面之後，\n就不能沒有像我這樣的覺悟了呀，是吧？"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 41,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER041.YBC",
      "sha256": "5ea63f0f7879fad1ce4f2a5ab7829b4f2439823cece24232399b64d74a70192b",
      "text_count": 11,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 127,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "伊諾森提雅終於要有所動作了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 128,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾也將成為點綴在織錦上的華麗絲線。\n他們展翅翱翔的時機也要到了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 276,
          "speaker_id": 127,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 326,
          "speaker_id": 129,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "誰將要去完成它？\n將要完成的又是什麼？\n接著，我們所將見證的未來，又是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 348,
          "speaker_id": 128,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 41,
          "source_offset": 382,
          "speaker_id": 127,
          "speaker": "隱者",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "一切都在那時間的長河之中。\n沒有光明，也沒有黑闇。\n只是，在那淡青色的雪中。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 414,
          "opcode": 15,
          "string_index": 1,
          "target": "data/adv/dat/Chapter210.ybc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 210,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER210.YBC",
      "sha256": "fefed25be023c1701d12ce08b8a360dfa24372bb9f5480333580c3ddfc06ad39",
      "text_count": 60,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 102,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "您果然還是要走了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 156,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "可不是嗎……\n就算黑闇已經籠罩在我所要走的道路上，\n也不可以因此而退縮呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 178,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 216,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "……你還真是了不起呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 242,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "你也是啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 264,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 286,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 330,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "如果可以的話，我也希望可以繼續留下來。\n然而，就像羅沙麗亞曾經做過的那樣，\n就像羅弗利也曾經做過的那樣。\n我這愚劣的僧人也應該要出發了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 356,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "要往北方出發？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 400,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15,
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "呼嗯。\n我會沿著那在伊斯特河邊設立的幾個聖者之泉\n走下去……\n打算就這樣地穿越阿修特羅斯的關口。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 422,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 450,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "「匍伏蔓延而來之物」是不會追到關口外面去\n的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 488,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "伊斯特的河畔，\n根本就已經是「匍伏蔓延而來之物」的巢穴了\n……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 510,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 550,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26,
            27,
            28
          ],
          "text": "他們之所以沒有佔領所有的聖者之泉，\n就是為了引誘我們過去。\n我並不是有意要詛咒你，\n但是這次……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 572,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 618,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            30,
            31,
            32,
            33,
            34
          ],
          "text": "德涅西亞，我可是僧侶呀。\n那值得尊敬的祖先們所立下的基礎，\n就是聖者之泉。\n你要我眼睜睜地看著它們遭受污染，\n這我可做不到。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 644,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 694,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            36,
            37,
            38,
            39,
            40
          ],
          "text": "那麼，就請您讓我們護送您到阿修特羅斯關口\n外面為止吧。\n至少……\n讓我們純潔之盾報答您這一段時間以來，\n對我們的恩情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 720,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 746,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 778,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            43,
            44
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。\n那麼我就歡喜地接受你的要求吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 804,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "……法爾德。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 842,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            46,
            47,
            48
          ],
          "text": "德涅西亞。\n你曾經想過在離別的時刻，\n竟然還能如此地歡喜嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 864,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 898,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "你有個很好的徒弟，\n而我也能看見你這個好徒弟正在造就一些好孩\n子。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 924,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 968,
          "speaker_id": 117,
          "speaker": "法爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            54,
            55,
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "那麼，年輕的純潔之盾首領呀，\n一切就都拜託你處理了，\n雖然我這老頭來日已然無多，\n不過我這一輩子都不會忘記你的恩情的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 210,
          "source_offset": 1000,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "……賭上純潔之盾的名譽，\n我們一定會安全地護送您出去。"
        }
      ],
